  "description": "The native launcher of Shenora, the hybrid app framework for .NET + React: the applier that runs BEFORE your app and applies a staged update, for framework-dependent apps whose runtime may be absent and whose files may be held open. Ships per-RID binaries (win-x64, linux-x64) plus the C++17 library sources and the main.cpp template, so you can build your launcher from the same library, and compile into it a startup screen shown from the first moment until your app's first window. The stock binary is the template built as it ships: it starts app/MyApp.exe, so it suits an app of that name or a trial of the protocol. A self-contained app needs none of this — the Shenora package's UpdateStage.ApplyAsync already applies updates in portable .NET.",
